1
00:00:00,610 --> 00:00:02,070
(Howard:)Hey, what's up?

2
00:00:02,070 --> 00:00:06,750
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Is that my future
daughter-in-law, the doctor?!

3
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:10,850
(Howard:)No, Ma! It's Raj!

4
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:13,150
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)He's a doctor
too, right?!

5
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:14,920
(Howard:)Yes!

6
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:17,290
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Like Leonard and
the skinny weirdo!

7
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,330
(Howard:)Sheldon, yes!

8
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:23,490
(Howard:)Everybody's a doctor but me!

9
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,060
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Well, whose fault
is that?!

10
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:29,400
(Howard:)What's up?

11
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:32,100
(Raj:)Leonard's putting disgusting
memories in

12
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,670
(Raj:)my memory foam mattress.

13
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:36,040
(Raj:)Can I stay here tonight?

14
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:38,640
(Howard:)Sure, but I'm going out
with Bernadette.

15
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,280
(Howard:)It'll just be you and my mother.

16
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:41,850
(Raj:)I guess that's okay.

17
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:45,480
(Howard:)Ma, can Rajesh sleep over?!

18
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:48,250
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Of course, he and I
can play doctor!

19
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:54,120
(Raj:)She's kidding, right?

20
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:56,690
(Howard:)I don't know, she's pretty
feisty since

21
00:00:56,690 --> 00:01:00,020
(Howard:)they put her on
hormone-replacement therapy.

